/p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-bqiRlB lmsiOl pf-352047100218-1109_"><button type="button" class="sc-iqseJM eiaQxO pf-352047100218-1110_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="77ae63c1-c56f-43e0-9293-ca52b4c05374" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-caret-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Quel type de pile faut-il mettre dans cet accessoire ?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="77ae63c1-c56f-43e0-9293-ca52b4c05374" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-crHmcD engWc pf-352047100218-1112_"><div class="sc-fotOHu cVvtTU pf-352047100218-1113_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fXEqDS hwCMhq pf-352047100218-1114_"><p class="sc-fXeWAj hLqvjI pf-352047100218-1115_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kiIyQV bOAJVC pf-352047100218-1117_">Le détecteur de vibration fonctionne avec une pile Lithium-lon, 23A 12V</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-bqiRlB lmsiOl pf-352047100218-1118_"><button type="button" class="sc-iqseJM eiaQxO pf-352047100218-1119_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="93ca52b4-c053-4492-86e8-befe369519d7" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-caret-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Suis-je prévenu lorsqu’il faut remplacer la pile ?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="93ca52b4-c053-4492-86e8-befe369519d7" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-crHmcD engWc pf-352047100218-1121_"><div class="sc-fotOHu cVvtTU pf-352047100218-1122_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fXEqDS hwCMhq pf-352047100218-1123_"><p class="sc-fXeWAj hLqvjI pf-352047100218-1124_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-