LmzF ixJFjA pf-352047100218-1298_"><button type="button" data-pf-tab-active="true" class="sc-jtXEFf dDpuav pf-352047100218-1299_ pf-anchor" data-pf-type="TabHeader"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kiIyQV bOAJVC pf-352047100218-1301_">WOS301</span></button><button type="button" data-pf-tab-active="false" class="sc-jtXEFf dDpuav pf-352047100218-1302_ pf-anchor" data-pf-type="TabHeader"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kiIyQV bOAJVC pf-352047100218-1304_">WOS301S</span></button></div><div data-pf-type="TabContentWrapper" class="sc-dwsnSq jHpHTT pf-352047100218-1305_"><div data-pf-expandable="true" style="display:block" data-pf-type="TabsContent" class="sc-eldieg cgXLDd pf-352047100218-1306_"><div class="sc-fotOHu cVvtTU pf-352047100218-1307_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:5"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fXEqDS hwCMhq pf-352047100218-1308_"><div data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-dkYRCH kEvBNx pf-352047100218-1309_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0326/3132/4811/t/4/assets/wos301-1675171989640.png?v=1675172005" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0326/3132/4811/t/4/assets/wos301-1675171989640.png?v=1675172005 1536w" width="1500" height="1500" alt="Visiophone DB501W"/></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:7"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fXEqDS hwCMhq pf-352047100218-1310_"><div class="sc-egiyK fNXPIL pf-352047100218-1311_ pf-icon-right" data-scrolling="false" data-multiple="false" data-pf-type="Accordion"><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-bqiRlB lmsiOl pf-352047100218-1312_"><button type="button" class="sc-iqseJM eiaQxO pf-352047100218-1313_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="f8fc7d44-9be0-42ab-9a36-1491b7c3ed25" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Quelle est la réglementation en vigueur pour les alarme intrusion ?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="f8fc7d44-9be0-42ab-9a36-1491b7c3ed25" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-crHmcD engWc pf-352047100218-1315_"><p class="sc-fXeWAj hLqvjI pf-352047100218-1316_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kiIyQV bOAJVC pf-352047100218-1318_">Aucune réglementation n'est vraiment définie en France concernant les sirènes d'alarme. La norme, fixée par les arrêtés préfectoraux ou communaux, concernant les sirènes, est en général d'un son de 105 décibels pour 3 minutes de fonctionnement.</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-bqiRlB lmsiOl pf-352047100218-1319_"><button type="button" class="sc-iqseJM eiaQxO pf-352047100218-1320_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="ab9a3614-91b7-43ed-a58b-15e79666a844" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>La sirène résiste-t-elle aux intempéries ? </span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="ab9a3614-91b7-43ed-a58b-15e79666a844" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-crHmcD engWc pf-352047100218-1322_"><p class="sc-fXeWAj hLqvjI pf-352047100218-1323_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kiIyQV bOAJVC pf-352047100218-1325_">Spécialement conçue pour résister aux intempéries, vous n'aurez pas besoin de la placer sous un toit ou un abris, elle trouvera sa place à l'endroit souhaité.</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-bqiRlB lmsiOl pf-352047100218-1326_"><button type="button" class="sc-iqseJM eiaQxO pf-352047100218-1327_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="ed258b15-e796-46a8-8431-62501d3b1dff" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>La sirène nécessite t-elle une alimentation électrique ? </span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="ed258b15-e796-46a8-8431-62501d3b1dff" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-crHmcD engWc pf-352047100218-1329_"><p class="sc-fXeWAj hLqvjI pf-352047100218-1330_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kiIyQV bOAJVC pf-352047100218-1332_">La sirène extérieure s'installe sur une prise secteur et nécessite donc d'une alimentation électrique.</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-bqiRlB lmsiOl pf-352047100218-1333_"><button type="button" class="sc-iqseJM eiaQxO pf-352047100218-1334_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="a8443162-501d-4b1d-bf62-2a6609e39ae7" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>La sirène déclenche t-elle un flash lumineux ?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="a8443162-501d-4b1d-bf62-2a6609e39ae7" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-crHmcD engWc pf-352047100218-1336_"><p class="sc-fXeWAj hLqvjI pf-352047100218-1337_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kiIyQV bOAJVC pf-352047100218-1339_">Oui, la sirène est équipée d'un flash lumineux dissuasif.</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-bqiRlB lmsiOl pf-352047100218-1340_"><button type="button" class="sc-iqseJM eiaQxO pf-352047100218-1341_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="3e047712-82c6-4fd3-971c-10786fc39aaf" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Ma sirène se déclenche sans que ma centrale ne réagisse. Comment faire ?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="3e047712-82c6-4fd3-971c-10786fc39aaf" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-crHmcD engWc pf-352047100218-1343_"><div class="sc-fotOHu cVvtTU pf-352047100218-1344_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fXEqDS hwCMhq pf-352047100218-1345_"><p class="sc-gIDmLj eMdhGW p